# Multi-page contract for design services between a studio and a cooperative: header
# in a Page overlay with the logo from the second sheet on (the first carries the title), footer with initials,
# the Parties section (with the parties in bold, thanks to Markup: markdown in the Paragraph rule) and the
# Recitals section, twelve numbered clauses with subsections written in Markdown (lists with three numbering
# levels), an annex with the fee table (with header and footer) and the
# signature block, which is not split across pages. The titles are written in lowercase and the rules
# of styles.stxt put them in uppercase (Case). The sections (Parties, Recitals, Clauses) are
# numbered Heading 2 (Numbered: true in styles.stxt) and the contract title declares Numbered: false.
# The annex is a Heading 1 with the annex style, numbered in Roman numerals (Number format, in styles.stxt) with its
# label (Number label: "Appendix I · ...", in the document because it is text and styles.stxt serves both languages), which
# the clauses refer to with {number of: annex-title}; recital III
# refers to the clauses section with {number of: terms}.
