						On the one hand, **Lumen Estudio de Diseño, S.L.P.**, Tax ID B-55123987, with registered address at Calle de la Ribera, 8, Olot (Girona), represented by Ms. Irene Calvo Mas, as its director (hereinafter, “the Studio”).
			Block:
